en.fuller:
περι-βάλλω
[in LXX chiefly for כָּסָה pi., also for לָבַשׁ, עָטָה, etc. ;]
to throw around or over, put on or over;
__(a) of siege or defen­sive works: χάρακά σοι, Luk.19:43 (WH, mg.; παρεμβ-, WH, txt.);
__(b) of clothing, to put on, wrap about, clothe with: with accusative of thing(s), Luk.23:11; with accusative of person(s), Mat.25:36, 38 25:43; with dupl. accusative (not cl.; Bl., § 34, 4), Jhn.19:2; pf. pass., to have wrapped round one: with accusative of thing(s) (cl.), Mrk.14:51 16:5, Rev.7:9, 13 10:1 11:3 12:1 17:4 18:16 19:13; with dative of thing(s), Rev.4:4 (WH, txt.; before ἐν, WH, mg.); fut., before ἐν (of. Deu.22:12, Psa.45:9, 13), Rev.3:5. Mid., to clothe oneself, wrap round or put on oneself: absol., Mat.6:29, Luk.12:27, Rev.3:18; with accusative of thing(s), Mat.6:31, Act.12:8, Rev.19:8.†
(AS)

es.fuller:
περι-βάλλω
[en LXX princ. for כָּסָה pi., also for לָבַשׁ, עָטָה, etc. ;]
to throw around or over, put on or over;
(a) of siege or defen­sive works: χάρακά σοι, Lc.19:43 (WH, mg.; παρεμβ-, WH, txt.);
(b) of clothing, to put on, wrap about, clothe with: con acus. de cosa, Lc.23:11; con acus. de pers., Mt.25:36, 38 25:43; with dupl. acus. (not clás.; Bl., § 34, 4), Jn.19:2; pf. pas., to have wrapped round one: con acus. de cosa (clás.), Mc.14:51 16:5, Ap.7:9, 13 10:1 11:3 12:1 17:4 18:16 19:13; con dat. de cosa, Ap.4:4 (WH, txt.; before ἐν, WH, mg.); fut., before ἐν (of. Dt.22:12, Sal.45:9, 13), Ap.3:5. med., to clothe oneself, wrap round or put on oneself: abs., Mt.6:29, Lc.12:27, Ap.3:18; con acus. de cosa, Mt.6:31, Hch.12:8, Ap.19:8.†
(AS)

he.fuller:
περι-βάλλω
[בשבעים בעיקר for כָּסָה פיעל, also for לָבַשׁ, עָטָה, ועוד ;]
to throw around or over, put on or over;
(a) of siege or defen­sive works: χάρακά σοι, לוקס.19:43 (WH, mg.; παρεμβ-, WH, txt.);
(b) of clothing, to put on, wrap about, clothe with: עם ישי׳ של דבר, לוקס.23:11; עם ישי׳ של אדם, מתי.25:36, 38 25:43; with dupl. ישי׳ (not קלאסית; Bl., § 34, 4), יוחנן.19:2; pf. סביל, to have wrapped round one: עם ישי׳ של דבר (קלאסית), מרקוס.14:51 16:5, התג.7:9, 13 10:1 11:3 12:1 17:4 18:16 19:13; עם עקיף של דבר, התג.4:4 (WH, txt.; before ἐν, WH, mg.); fut., before ἐν (of. דב.22:12, תה.45:9, 13), התג.3:5. בינוני, to clothe oneself, wrap round or put on oneself: מוחלט, מתי.6:29, לוקס.12:27, התג.3:18; עם ישי׳ של דבר, מתי.6:31, מע״ש.12:8, התג.19:8.†
(AS)

en.fuller:
περι-τομή, -ῆς, ἡ
(περιτέμνω), [in LXX: Gen.17:13, Exo.4:25-26 (מוּל ni., מוּלָה), Jer.11:16 * ;]
circumcision;
__(a) of the rite itself : Jhn.7:22-23 Act.7:8, Rom.4:11, Gal.5:11, Php.3:5;
__(b) of the state of circumcision: Rom.2:25-28 3:1, 1Co.7:19, Gal.5:6 6:15, Col.3:11; ἐν π. ὤν, Rom.4:10;
__(with) by meton., π. = οἱ περιτμηθέντες, the circumcised: Rom.3:30 4:9, 12 15:8, Gal.2:7-9, Eph.2:11; οἱ ἐκ τῆς π., of Jews, Rom.4:12; of Jewish Christians, Act.11:2, Gal.2:12, Tit.1:10; οἱ ἐκ π. πιστοί, Act.10:45; οἱ ὄντες ἐκ π., Col.4:11 Metaphorical, Rom.2:29, Col.2:11, Php.3:3.†
(AS)

